  "markdown-it:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<h1>Heading inside a quote</h1>\\n' +\n  '<p>And a paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote>\\n<div>\\n*not emphasized inside quoted div*\\n</div></blockquote>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code>a ` b</code> for literal backticks.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text <!-- trailing comment --></h1>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Code</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Note</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>literal</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- a standalone block comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After the comment.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-in-indented-code": "'<!-- comment inside an indented code block -->\\n' +\n  '<pre><code>still code\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-in-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>First item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items -->\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Second item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><!-- raw comment --></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>visible</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-multiline": "'<!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n-->'",
  "markdown-it:comment-only": "'<!-- the entire document is only this comment -->'",
  "markdown-it:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>&lt;!-- a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>b --&gt;</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:comment-with-markdown": "'<!-- **bold** _italic_ and [a link](https://example.com) inside a comment -->'",
  "markdown-it:comment-with-raw-html": "'<!-- <div class=\"x\">raw tags</div> and <script>alert(1)</script> inside -->'",
  "markdown-it:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:div-markdown-attr": "'<div markdown=\"1\">\\n*does markdown=\"1\" change anything?*\\n</div>'",
  "markdown-it:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open <span>span</span> still emphasized</em></p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language\\n</code></pre>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"language-js\">const x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);\\n</code></pre>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.[^1]</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>[^1]: This is the footnote definition.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference[^a] and second reference[^b] in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>[^a]: First footnote.\\n' +\n  '[^b]: Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash<br>\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces<br>\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<h1>a heading</h1>\\n</div>'",
  "markdown-it:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n# not a heading\\n</div>'",
  "markdown-it:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n<p>Some text under the heading.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>'",
  "markdown-it:html-inside-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Tag</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Example</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>bold</td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>hi</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>break</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a<br>b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\"></p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\nsecond line</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:inline-html": "'<p>Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:list-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>a list item</li>\\n<li>another list item</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>'",
  "markdown-it:list-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n</div>'",
  "markdown-it:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>A list item containing</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Next item</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>First step:</p>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">echo hello\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Second step after the code block.</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item two with a blank line before it</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\ncontent\\n</div>\\n*not emphasized — still in the HTML block*'",
  "markdown-it:md-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n</div>'",
  "markdown-it:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n</div>'",
  "markdown-it:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code><em>emphasized inside a code tag</em></code> here.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n</pre>'",
  "markdown-it:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td>*not emphasized* in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>'",
  "markdown-it:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright © less-than &lt; and a non-entity  .</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal # and hex ☺ entities.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- this is an HTML comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1>\\n<h2>Heading two</h2>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:setext-vs-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>item</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote &quot; in plain text.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <s>struck through</s> text.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><s>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</s></p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is ~single tilde~ text.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:table-alignment": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th style=\"text-align:left\">Left</th>\\n' +\n  '<th style=\"text-align:center\">Center</th>\\n' +\n  '<th style=\"text-align:right\">Right</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:left\">a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:center\">b</td>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:right\">c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:left\">dd</td>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:center\">ee</td>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:right\">ff</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:table-basic": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Fruit</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Color</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Apple</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Red</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Lime</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Green</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Column</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Value</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>pipe</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a | b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:table-inline-formatting": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Syntax</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Renders</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>code</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>bold</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><s>old</s></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:table-no-body": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:table-ragged": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>C</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>only one</td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>1</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>2</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>3</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:tagfilter": "'<p>A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:tasklist": "'<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:tasklist-nested": "'<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Parent task\\n' +\n  '<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Child todo</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr>\\n<p>Below</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose two</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-it:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>\\n'",
  "markdown-rs:alert-caution": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!CAUTION]\\n' +\n  'Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:alert-important": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!IMPORTANT]\\n' +\n  'Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:alert-note": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!NOTE]\\n' +\n  'Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:alert-tip": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!TIP]\\n' +\n  'Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:alert-warning": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!WARNING]\\n' +\n  'Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&amp;b=2&amp;c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading 2</h2>\\n' +\n  '<h3>Heading 3</h3>\\n' +\n  '<h4>Heading 4</h4>\\n' +\n  '<h5>Heading 5</h5>\\n' +\n  '<h6>Heading 6</h6>'",
  "markdown-rs:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at <a href=\"mailto:someone@example.com\">someone@example.com</a> please.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link <a href=\"http://www.example.com/foo_(bar)\">www.example.com/foo_(bar)</a> with balanced parens.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (<a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>) and <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>. and <a href=\"https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2\">https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2</a>.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> for more, or <a href=\"http://test.org\">http://test.org</a> too.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out <a href=\"http://www.example.com\">www.example.com</a> for details.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code>code with ` backtick</code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n<p>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</p>\\n</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<h1>Heading inside a quote</h1>\\n' +\n  '<p>And a paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  '*not emphasized inside quoted div*\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "markdown-rs:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code>a ` b</code> for literal backticks.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text &lt;!-- trailing comment --&gt;</h1>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Code</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Note</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>literal</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '&lt;!-- a standalone block comment --&gt;\\n' +\n  '<p>After the comment.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-in-indented-code": "'&lt;!-- comment inside an indented code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '<pre><code>still code\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-in-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>First item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '&lt;!-- comment between items --&gt;\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Second item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>&lt;!-- raw comment --&gt;</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>visible</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before &lt;!-- inline comment --&gt; and text after.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-multiline": "'&lt;!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n--&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-only": "'&lt;!-- the entire document is only this comment --&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>&lt;!-- a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>b --&gt;</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-with-markdown": "'&lt;!-- **bold** _italic_ and [a link](https://example.com) inside a comment --&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:comment-with-raw-html": "'&lt;!-- &lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;raw tags&lt;/div&gt; and &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; inside --&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:div-markdown-attr": "'&lt;div markdown=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '*does markdown=&quot;1&quot; change anything?*\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></p>'",
  "markdown-rs:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open &lt;span&gt;span&lt;/span&gt; still emphasized</em></p>'",
  "markdown-rs:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language\\n</code></pre>'",
  "markdown-rs:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"language-js\">const x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);\\n</code></pre>'",
  "markdown-rs:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup></p>\\n' +\n  '<section data-footnotes=\"\" class=\"footnotes\"><h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"user-content-fn-1\">\\n' +\n  '<p>This is the footnote definition. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to content\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</section>\\n'",
  "markdown-rs:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-a\" id=\"user-content-fnref-a\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup> and second reference<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-b\" id=\"user-content-fnref-b\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">2</a></sup> in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '<section data-footnotes=\"\" class=\"footnotes\"><h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"user-content-fn-a\">\\n' +\n  '<p>First footnote. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-a\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to content\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"user-content-fn-b\">\\n' +\n  '<p>Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-b\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to content\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</section>\\n'",
  "markdown-rs:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash<br />\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces<br />\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:heading-in-div-loose": "'&lt;div&gt;\\n<h1>a heading</h1>\\n&lt;/div&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:heading-in-div-tight": "'&lt;div&gt;\\n# not a heading\\n&lt;/div&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n<p>Some text under the heading.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:html-block": "'&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;p&gt;A raw HTML block.&lt;/p&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:html-inside-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Tag</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Example</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>bold</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>&lt;strong&gt;hi&lt;/strong&gt;</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>break</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a&lt;br&gt;b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\" /></p>'",
  "markdown-rs:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\nsecond line</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:inline-html": "'<p>Text with &lt;strong&gt;inline html&lt;/strong&gt; and a &lt;br&gt; break.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:list-in-div-loose": "'&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>a list item</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>another list item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:list-in-div-tight": "'&lt;div&gt;\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n&lt;/div&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>A list item containing</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Next item</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "markdown-rs:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>First step:</p>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">echo hello\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Second step after the code block.</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "markdown-rs:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item two with a blank line before it</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "markdown-rs:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>'",
  "markdown-rs:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'&lt;div&gt;\\ncontent\\n&lt;/div&gt;\\n*not emphasized — still in the HTML block*'",
  "markdown-rs:md-in-div-loose": "'&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:md-in-div-tight": "'&lt;div&gt;\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n&lt;/div&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline &lt;code&gt;<em>emphasized inside a code tag</em>&lt;/code&gt; here.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline &lt;span&gt;<em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong>&lt;/span&gt; stay markdown.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:md-in-pre": "'&lt;pre&gt;\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n&lt;/pre&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:md-in-table-html": "'&lt;table&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;*not emphasized* in a raw table&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/table&gt;'",
  "markdown-rs:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright © less-than &lt; and a non-entity  .</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "markdown-rs:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "markdown-rs:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "markdown-rs:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal # and hex ☺ entities.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>'",
  "markdown-rs:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>'",
  "markdown-rs:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '&lt;!-- this is an HTML comment --&gt;\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "markdown-rs:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1>\\n<h2>Heading two</h2>'",
  "markdown-rs:setext-vs-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>item</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr />'",
  "markdown-rs:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote &quot; in plain text.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></p>'",
  "markdown-rs:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is <del>single tilde</del> text.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:table-alignment": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"left\">Left</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"center\">Center</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"right\">Right</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">b</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">dd</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">ee</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">ff</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:table-basic": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Fruit</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Color</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Apple</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Red</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Lime</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Green</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Column</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Value</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>pipe</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a | b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:table-inline-formatting": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Syntax</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Renders</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>code</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>bold</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><del>old</del></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:table-no-body": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:table-ragged": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>C</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>only one</td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>1</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>2</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>3</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "markdown-rs:tagfilter": "'<p>A &lt;title&gt; tag and a &lt;textarea&gt; and &lt;xmp&gt; and &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; raw.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:tasklist": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "markdown-rs:tasklist-nested": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> Parent task\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> Child todo</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "markdown-rs:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "markdown-rs:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr />\\n<p>Below</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose two</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "markdown-rs:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>'",
  "markdown-rs:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>'",
  "markdown:alert-caution": "'<blockquote><p>[!CAUTION]\\n' +\n  'Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:alert-important": "'<blockquote><p>[!IMPORTANT]\\n' +\n  'Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:alert-note": "'<blockquote><p>[!NOTE]\\n' +\n  'Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:alert-tip": "'<blockquote><p>[!TIP]\\n' +\n  'Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:alert-warning": "'<blockquote><p>[!WARNING]\\n' +\n  'Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&amp;b=2&amp;c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>'",
  "markdown:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading 2</h2>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<h3>Heading 3</h3>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<h4>Heading 4</h4>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<h5>Heading 5</h5>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<h6>Heading 6</h6>'",
  "markdown:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at someone@example.com please.</p>'",
  "markdown:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link www.example.com/foo_(bar) with balanced parens.</p>'",
  "markdown:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (https://example.com) and https://example.com. and https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2.</p>'",
  "markdown:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit https://example.com for more, or http://test.org too.</p>'",
  "markdown:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out www.example.com for details.</p>'",
  "markdown:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>'",
  "markdown:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code> code with ` backtick </code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</p>'",
  "markdown:blockquote": "'<blockquote><p>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</p></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote><h1>Heading inside a quote</h1><p>And a paragraph.</p></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote><p>&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized inside quoted div</em>\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</p></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:code-block-with-html": "'<p><code>html\\n' +\n  '&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></p>'",
  "markdown:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code> a ` b </code> for literal backticks.</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text &lt;!-- trailing comment --&gt;</h1>'",
  "markdown:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<p>| Code | Note |\\n' +\n  '| ---- | ---- |\\n' +\n  '| <code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code> | literal |</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>&lt;!-- a standalone block comment --&gt;</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>After the comment.</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<p><code>html\\n' +\n  '&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></p>'",
  "markdown:comment-in-indented-code": "'<p>&lt;!-- comment inside an indented code block --&gt;\\n    still code</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-in-list": "'<ul><li>First item\\n' +\n  '&lt;!-- comment between items --&gt;</li><li>Second item</li></ul>'",
  "markdown:comment-in-table-cell": "'<p>| Col A | Col B |\\n' +\n  '| ----- | ----- |\\n' +\n  '| &lt;!-- raw comment --&gt; | visible |</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before &lt;!-- inline comment --&gt; and text after.</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-multiline": "'<p>&lt;!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n--&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-only": "'<p>&lt;!-- the entire document is only this comment --&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<p>| A | B |\\n| - | - |\\n| &lt;!-- a | b --&gt; | c |</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-with-markdown": "'<p>&lt;!-- <strong>bold</strong> <em>italic</em> and <a href=\"https://example.com\">a link</a> inside a comment --&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:comment-with-raw-html": "'<p>&lt;!-- &lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;raw tags&lt;/div&gt; and &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; inside --&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>'",
  "markdown:div-markdown-attr": "'<p>&lt;div markdown=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>does markdown=&quot;1&quot; change anything?</em>\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.</p>'",
  "markdown:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>*bold italic</strong>*</p>'",
  "markdown:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open &lt;span&gt;span&lt;/span&gt; still emphasized</em></p>'",
  "markdown:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>'",
  "markdown:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a \\\\| b \\\\| c just text with escaped pipes.</p>'",
  "markdown:fenced-code": "'<p><code>\\nplain fenced code\\nno language\\n</code></p>'",
  "markdown:fenced-code-lang": "'<p><code>js\\nconst x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);\\n</code></p>'",
  "markdown:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.<a href=\"This\">^1</a></p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p> is the footnote definition.</p>'",
  "markdown:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference<a href=\"First\">^a</a> and second reference[^b] in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p> footnote.\\n' +\n  '[^b]: Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>.</p>'",
  "markdown:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash\\\\\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>'",
  "markdown:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces<br/>Line two after a hard break.</p>'",
  "markdown:heading-in-div-loose": "'<p>&lt;div&gt;</p>\\n\\n<h1>a heading</h1>\\n\\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:heading-in-div-tight": "'<p>&lt;div&gt;</p>\\n\\n<h1>not a heading</h1>\\n\\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n\\n<p>Some text under the heading.</p>'",
  "markdown:html-block": "'<p>&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;p&gt;A raw HTML block.&lt;/p&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:html-inside-table": "'<p>| Tag | Example |\\n' +\n  '| --- | ------- |\\n' +\n  '| bold | &lt;strong&gt;hi&lt;/strong&gt; |\\n' +\n  '| break | a&lt;br&gt;b |</p>'",
  "markdown:image": "'<p><img alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\" src=\"https://example.com/image.png\"/></p>'",
  "markdown:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\n    second line</p>'",
  "markdown:inline-html": "'<p>Text with &lt;strong&gt;inline html&lt;/strong&gt; and a &lt;br&gt; break.</p>'",
  "markdown:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>'",
  "markdown:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo<em>bar</em>baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>'",
  "markdown:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>'",
  "markdown:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>'",
  "markdown:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>'",
  "markdown:list-in-div-loose": "'<p>&lt;div&gt;</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<ul><li>a list item</li><li>another list item</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:list-in-div-tight": "'<p>&lt;div&gt;\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul><li><p>A list item containing</p><p>&gt; a blockquote\\n' +\n  '&gt; inside the item</p></li><li><p>Next item</p></li></ul>'",
  "markdown:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol><li><p>First step:</p><p><code>bash\\n' +\n  'echo hello\\n' +\n  '</code></p></li><li><p>Second step after the code block.</p></li></ol>'",
  "markdown:loose-list": "'<ul><li><p>Item one</p></li><li><p>Item two with a blank line before it</p></li></ul>'",
  "markdown:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum<em>{i=1}^{n} x</em>i\\n$$</p>'",
  "markdown:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>'",
  "markdown:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<p>&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>'",
  "markdown:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<p>&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized — still in the HTML block</em></p>'",
  "markdown:md-in-div-loose": "'<p>&lt;div&gt;</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:md-in-div-tight": "'<p>&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized</em> and <strong>not bold</strong>\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline &lt;code&gt;<em>emphasized inside a code tag</em>&lt;/code&gt; here.</p>'",
  "markdown:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline &lt;span&gt;<em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong>&lt;/span&gt; stay markdown.</p>'",
  "markdown:md-in-pre": "'<p>&lt;pre&gt;\\n<em>not emphasized</em> and # not a heading\\n&lt;/pre&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:md-in-table-html": "'<p>&lt;table&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;<em>not emphasized</em> in a raw table&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/table&gt;</p>'",
  "markdown:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>'",
  "markdown:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>'",
  "markdown:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp;amp; copyright &amp;copy; less-than &amp;lt; and a non-entity &amp;nbsp;.</p>'",
  "markdown:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote><p>Outer</p><blockquote><p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p></blockquote></blockquote>'",
  "markdown:nested-list": "'<ul><li>Top<ul><li>Nested one</li><li>Nested two<ul><li>Deeper</li></ul></li></ul></li><li>Back to top</li></ul>'",
  "markdown:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol><li>Ordered parent<ul><li>Unordered child<ol><li>Ordered grandchild</li></ol></li><li>Another child</li></ul></li></ol>'",
  "markdown:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal &amp;#35; and hex &amp;#x263A; entities.</p>'",
  "markdown:ordered-list": "'<ol><li>First</li><li>Second</li><li>Third</li></ol>'",
  "markdown:ordered-list-start": "'<ol><li>Five</li><li>Six</li><li>Seven</li></ol>'",
  "markdown:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>'",
  "markdown:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>'",
  "markdown:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>&lt;!-- this is an HTML comment --&gt;</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>'",
  "markdown:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>'",
  "markdown:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1>\\n\\n<h2>Heading two</h2>'",
  "markdown:setext-vs-list": "'<h2>- item</h2>'",
  "markdown:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote &quot; in plain text.</p>'",
  "markdown:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is ~~struck through~~ text.</p>'",
  "markdown:strikethrough-nested": "'<p>~~struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside~~</p>'",
  "markdown:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is ~single tilde~ text.</p>'",
  "markdown:table-alignment": "'<p>| Left | Center | Right |\\n' +\n  '| :--- | :----: | ----: |\\n' +\n  '| a    | b      | c     |\\n' +\n  '| dd   | ee     | ff    |</p>'",
  "markdown:table-basic": "'<p>| Fruit | Color |\\n| ----- | ----- |\\n| Apple | Red |\\n| Lime  | Green |</p>'",
  "markdown:table-escaped-pipe": "'<p>| Column | Value |\\n| ------ | ----- |\\n| pipe   | a \\\\| b |</p>'",
  "markdown:table-inline-formatting": "'<p>| Syntax | Renders |\\n' +\n  '| ------ | ------- |\\n' +\n  '| <code>code</code> | <strong>bold</strong> |\\n' +\n  '| ~~old~~ | <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a> |</p>'",
  "markdown:table-no-body": "'<p>| Header A | Header B |\\n| -------- | -------- |</p>'",
  "markdown:table-ragged": "'<p>| A | B | C |\\n| - | - | - |\\n| only one |\\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 |</p>'",
  "markdown:tagfilter": "'<p>A &lt;title&gt; tag and a &lt;textarea&gt; and &lt;xmp&gt; and &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; raw.</p>'",
  "markdown:tasklist": "'<ul><li>[x] Completed task</li><li>[ ] Incomplete task</li><li>[X] Capital X also checked</li></ul>'",
  "markdown:tasklist-nested": "'<ul><li>[ ] Parent task<ul><li>[x] Child done</li><li>[ ] Child todo</li></ul></li></ul>'",
  "markdown:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul><li>[x] Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li><li>[ ] Task with <code>code</code></li></ul>'",
  "markdown:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n\\n<hr/>\\n\\n<p>Below</p>'",
  "markdown:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul><li>tight one</li><li>tight two</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<ol><li><p>loose one</p></li><li><p>loose two</p></li></ol>'",
  "markdown:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>'",
  "markdown:unordered-list": "'<ul><li>Apple</li><li>Banana</li><li>Cherry</li></ul>'",
  "marked-github:alert-caution": "'<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-caution\">\\n' +\n  '<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-stop mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.47.22A.749.749 0 0 1 5 0h6c.199 0 .389.079.53.22l4.25 4.25c.141.14.22.331.22.53v6a.749.749 0 0 1-.22.53l-4.25 4.25A.749.749 0 0 1 11 16H5a.749.749 0 0 1-.53-.22L.22 11.53A.749.749 0 0 1 0 11V5c0-.199.079-.389.22-.53Zm.84 1.28L1.5 5.31v5.38l3.81 3.81h5.38l3.81-3.81V5.31L10.69 1.5ZM8 4a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 8 4Zm0 8a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Caution</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n'",
  "marked-github:alert-important": "'<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-important\">\\n' +\n  '<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-report mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"></path></svg>Important</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n'",
  "marked-github:alert-note": "'<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\">\\n' +\n  '<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n'",
  "marked-github:alert-tip": "'<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-tip\">\\n' +\n  '<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-light-bulb mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 1.5c-2.363 0-4 1.69-4 3.75 0 .984.424 1.625.984 2.304l.214.253c.223.264.47.556.673.848.284.411.537.896.621 1.49a.75.75 0 0 1-1.484.211c-.04-.282-.163-.547-.37-.847a8.456 8.456 0 0 0-.542-.68c-.084-.1-.173-.205-.268-.32C3.201 7.75 2.5 6.766 2.5 5.25 2.5 2.31 4.863 0 8 0s5.5 2.31 5.5 5.25c0 1.516-.701 2.5-1.328 3.259-.095.115-.184.22-.268.319-.207.245-.383.453-.541.681-.208.3-.33.565-.37.847a.751.751 0 0 1-1.485-.212c.084-.593.337-1.078.621-1.489.203-.292.45-.584.673-.848.075-.088.147-.173.213-.253.561-.679.985-1.32.985-2.304 0-2.06-1.637-3.75-4-3.75ZM5.75 12h4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM6 15.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Z\"></path></svg>Tip</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n'",
  "marked-github:alert-warning": "'<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-warning\">\\n' +\n  '<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-alert mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.457 1.047c.659-1.234 2.427-1.234 3.086 0l6.082 11.378A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.082 15H1.918a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.543-2.575Zm1.763.707a.25.25 0 0 0-.44 0L1.698 13.132a.25.25 0 0 0 .22.368h12.164a.25.25 0 0 0 .22-.368Zm.53 3.996v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 11a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"></path></svg>Warning</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n'",
  "marked-github:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&b=2&c=3\" rel=\"nofollow\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading 2</h2>\\n' +\n  '<h3>Heading 3</h3>\\n' +\n  '<h4>Heading 4</h4>\\n' +\n  '<h5>Heading 5</h5>\\n' +\n  '<h6>Heading 6</h6>\\n'",
  "marked-github:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at <a href=\"mailto:someone@example.com\">someone@example.com</a> please.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link <a href=\"http://www.example.com/foo_(bar)\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.example.com/foo_(bar)</a> with balanced parens.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (<a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://example.com</a>) and <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://example.com</a>. and <a href=\"https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2</a>.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://example.com</a> for more, or <a href=\"http://test.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://test.org</a> too.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out <a href=\"http://www.example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.example.com</a> for details.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code>code with ` backtick</code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n<p>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked-github:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<h1>Heading inside a quote</h1>\\n' +\n  '<p>And a paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked-github:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote>\\n<div>\\n*not emphasized inside quoted div*\\n</div></blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked-github:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;x&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\\n' +\n  '  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>alert(1)<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\\n' +\n  '<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "marked-github:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code>a ` b</code> for literal backticks.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text <!-- trailing comment --></h1>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Code</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Note</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>literal</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- a standalone block comment --><p>After the comment.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;</span>\\n' +\n  '<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>x<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "marked-github:comment-in-indented-code": "'<!-- comment inside an indented code block -->\\n' +\n  '<pre><code>still code\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "marked-github:comment-in-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>First item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items -->\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Second item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><!-- raw comment --></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>visible</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-multiline": "'<!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n-->'",
  "marked-github:comment-only": "'<!-- the entire document is only this comment -->'",
  "marked-github:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>&lt;!-- a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>b --&gt;</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:comment-with-markdown": "'<!-- **bold** _italic_ and [a link](https://example.com) inside a comment -->'",
  "marked-github:comment-with-raw-html": "'<!-- <div class=\"x\">raw tags</div> and <script>alert(1)</script> inside -->'",
  "marked-github:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:div-markdown-attr": "'<div markdown=\"1\">\\n*does markdown=\"1\" change anything?*\\n</div>'",
  "marked-github:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it 🚀 and celebrated 🎉 with 👍.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open <span>span</span> still emphasized</em></p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language\\n</code></pre>'",
  "marked-github:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"hljs language-js\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> x = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\\n' +\n  '<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(x);\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "marked-github:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.<sup><a id=\"footnote-ref-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" data-footnote-ref aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup></p>\\n' +\n  '<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>\\n' +\n  '<h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"footnote-1\">\\n' +\n  '<p>This is the footnote definition. <a href=\"#footnote-ref-1\" data-footnote-backref aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</section>\\n'",
  "marked-github:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference<sup><a id=\"footnote-ref-a\" href=\"#footnote-a\" data-footnote-ref aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup> and second reference<sup><a id=\"footnote-ref-b\" href=\"#footnote-b\" data-footnote-ref aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">2</a></sup> in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>\\n' +\n  '<h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"footnote-a\">\\n' +\n  '<p>First footnote. <a href=\"#footnote-ref-a\" data-footnote-backref aria-label=\"Back to reference a\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"footnote-b\">\\n' +\n  '<p>Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>. <a href=\"#footnote-ref-b\" data-footnote-backref aria-label=\"Back to reference b\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</section>\\n'",
  "marked-github:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash<br>Line two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces<br>Line two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div><h1>a heading</h1>\\n</div>'",
  "marked-github:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n# not a heading\\n</div>'",
  "marked-github:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n<p>Some text under the heading.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>'",
  "marked-github:html-inside-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Tag</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Example</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>bold</td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>hi</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>break</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a<br>b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\"></p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\n    second line</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:inline-html": "'<p>Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">inline link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:list-in-div-loose": "'<div><ul>\\n<li>a list item</li>\\n<li>another list item</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>'",
  "marked-github:list-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n</div>'",
  "marked-github:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>A list item containing</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Next item</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked-github:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>First step:</p>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">echo</span> hello\\n' +\n  '</code></pre></li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Second step after the code block.</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "marked-github:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Item one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Item two with a blank line before it</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked-github:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div><p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\ncontent\\n</div>\\n*not emphasized — still in the HTML block*'",
  "marked-github:md-in-div-loose": "'<div><p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n</div>'",
  "marked-github:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n</div>'",
  "marked-github:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code><em>emphasized inside a code tag</em></code> here.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n</pre>'",
  "marked-github:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td>*not emphasized* in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>'",
  "marked-github:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright &copy; less-than &lt; and a non-entity &nbsp;.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked-github:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked-github:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "marked-github:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal &#35; and hex &#x263A; entities.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "marked-github:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "marked-github:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- this is an HTML comment --><p>After comment.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1>\\n<h2>Heading two</h2>\\n'",
  "marked-github:setext-vs-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>item</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr>\\n'",
  "marked-github:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote &quot; in plain text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is <del>single tilde</del> text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:table-alignment": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"left\">Left</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"center\">Center</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"right\">Right</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">b</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">dd</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">ee</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">ff</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:table-basic": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Fruit</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Color</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Apple</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Red</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Lime</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Green</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Column</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Value</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>pipe</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a | b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:table-inline-formatting": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Syntax</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Renders</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>code</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>bold</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><del>old</del></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">link</a></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:table-no-body": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:table-ragged": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>C</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>only one</td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>1</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>2</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>3</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked-github:tagfilter": "'<p>A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:tasklist": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked-github:tasklist-nested": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Parent task<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Child todo</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked-github:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked-github:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr>\\n<p>Below</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>loose one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>loose two</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "marked-github:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>\\n'",
  "marked-github:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>\\n'",
  "marked:alert-caution": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!CAUTION]\\n' +\n  'Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:alert-important": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!IMPORTANT]\\n' +\n  'Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:alert-note": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!NOTE]\\n' +\n  'Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:alert-tip": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!TIP]\\n' +\n  'Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:alert-warning": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!WARNING]\\n' +\n  'Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&b=2&c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading 2</h2>\\n' +\n  '<h3>Heading 3</h3>\\n' +\n  '<h4>Heading 4</h4>\\n' +\n  '<h5>Heading 5</h5>\\n' +\n  '<h6>Heading 6</h6>\\n'",
  "marked:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at <a href=\"mailto:someone@example.com\">someone@example.com</a> please.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link <a href=\"http://www.example.com/foo_(bar)\">www.example.com/foo_(bar)</a> with balanced parens.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (<a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>) and <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>. and <a href=\"https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2\">https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2</a>.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> for more, or <a href=\"http://test.org\">http://test.org</a> too.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out <a href=\"http://www.example.com\">www.example.com</a> for details.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>\\n'",
  "marked:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code>code with ` backtick</code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n<p>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<h1>Heading inside a quote</h1>\\n' +\n  '<p>And a paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote>\\n<div>\\n*not emphasized inside quoted div*\\n</div></blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "marked:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code>a ` b</code> for literal backticks.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text <!-- trailing comment --></h1>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Code</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Note</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>literal</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- a standalone block comment --><p>After the comment.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-in-indented-code": "'<!-- comment inside an indented code block -->\\n' +\n  '<pre><code>still code\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-in-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>First item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items -->\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Second item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><!-- raw comment --></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>visible</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-multiline": "'<!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n-->'",
  "marked:comment-only": "'<!-- the entire document is only this comment -->'",
  "marked:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>&lt;!-- a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>b --&gt;</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>\\n'",
  "marked:comment-with-markdown": "'<!-- **bold** _italic_ and [a link](https://example.com) inside a comment -->'",
  "marked:comment-with-raw-html": "'<!-- <div class=\"x\">raw tags</div> and <script>alert(1)</script> inside -->'",
  "marked:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:div-markdown-attr": "'<div markdown=\"1\">\\n*does markdown=\"1\" change anything?*\\n</div>'",
  "marked:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></p>\\n'",
  "marked:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open <span>span</span> still emphasized</em></p>\\n'",
  "marked:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language\\n</code></pre>\\n'",
  "marked:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"language-js\">const x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);\\n</code></pre>\\n'",
  "marked:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.[^1]</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>[^1]: This is the footnote definition.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference[^a] and second reference[^b] in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>[^a]: First footnote.\\n' +\n  '[^b]: Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash<br>Line two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces<br>Line two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div><h1>a heading</h1>\\n</div>'",
  "marked:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n# not a heading\\n</div>'",
  "marked:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n<p>Some text under the heading.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>'",
  "marked:html-inside-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Tag</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Example</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>bold</td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>hi</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>break</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a<br>b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\"></p>\\n'",
  "marked:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\n    second line</p>\\n'",
  "marked:inline-html": "'<p>Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>\\n'",
  "marked:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:list-in-div-loose": "'<div><ul>\\n<li>a list item</li>\\n<li>another list item</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>'",
  "marked:list-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n</div>'",
  "marked:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>A list item containing</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Next item</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>First step:</p>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">echo hello\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Second step after the code block.</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "marked:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Item one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Item two with a blank line before it</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>\\n'",
  "marked:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div><p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>\\n'",
  "marked:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\ncontent\\n</div>\\n*not emphasized — still in the HTML block*'",
  "marked:md-in-div-loose": "'<div><p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n</div>'",
  "marked:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n</div>'",
  "marked:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code><em>emphasized inside a code tag</em></code> here.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n</pre>'",
  "marked:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td>*not emphasized* in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>'",
  "marked:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright &copy; less-than &lt; and a non-entity &nbsp;.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "marked:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "marked:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal &#35; and hex &#x263A; entities.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "marked:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "marked:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- this is an HTML comment --><p>After comment.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1>\\n<h2>Heading two</h2>\\n'",
  "marked:setext-vs-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>item</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr>\\n'",
  "marked:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote &quot; in plain text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></p>\\n'",
  "marked:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is <del>single tilde</del> text.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:table-alignment": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"left\">Left</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"center\">Center</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"right\">Right</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">b</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">dd</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">ee</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">ff</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:table-basic": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Fruit</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Color</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Apple</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Red</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Lime</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Green</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Column</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Value</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>pipe</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a | b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:table-inline-formatting": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Syntax</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Renders</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>code</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>bold</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><del>old</del></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:table-no-body": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "marked:table-ragged": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>C</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody><tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>only one</td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>1</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>2</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>3</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "marked:tagfilter": "'<p>A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:tasklist": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked:tasklist-nested": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Parent task<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Child todo</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "marked:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr>\\n<p>Below</p>\\n'",
  "marked:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>loose one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>loose two</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "marked:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>\\n'",
  "marked:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>\\n'",
  "md4w:alert-caution": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!CAUTION]\\n' +\n  'Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:alert-important": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!IMPORTANT]\\n' +\n  'Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:alert-note": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!NOTE]\\n' +\n  'Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:alert-tip": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!TIP]\\n' +\n  'Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:alert-warning": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!WARNING]\\n' +\n  'Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&b=2&c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1 <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-1\" href=\"#heading-1\"></a></h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading 2 <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-2\" href=\"#heading-2\"></a></h2>\\n' +\n  '<h3>Heading 3 <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-3\" href=\"#heading-3\"></a></h3>\\n' +\n  '<h4>Heading 4 <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-4\" href=\"#heading-4\"></a></h4>\\n' +\n  '<h5>Heading 5 <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-5\" href=\"#heading-5\"></a></h5>\\n' +\n  '<h6>Heading 6 <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-6\" href=\"#heading-6\"></a></h6>\\n'",
  "md4w:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at someone@example.com please.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link www.example.com/foo_(bar) with balanced parens.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (<a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>) and <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>. and <a href=\"https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2\">https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2</a>.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> for more, or <a href=\"http://test.org\">http://test.org</a> too.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out <a href=\"http://www.example.com\">www.example.com</a> for details.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code>code with ` backtick</code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n<p>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<h1>Heading inside a quote <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-inside-a-quote\" href=\"#heading-inside-a-quote\"></a></h1>\\n' +\n  '<p>And a paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote>\\n<div>\\n*not emphasized inside quoted div*\\n</div>\\n</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "md4w:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code>a ` b</code> for literal backticks.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text <!-- trailing comment --> <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-text\" href=\"#heading-text\"></a></h1>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Code</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Note</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>literal</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- a standalone block comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After the comment.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-in-indented-code": "'<!-- comment inside an indented code block -->\\n' +\n  '<pre><code>still code\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-in-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>First item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items -->\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Second item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><!-- raw comment --></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>visible</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-multiline": "'<!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n-->\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-only": "'<!-- the entire document is only this comment -->\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><!-- a | b --></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-with-markdown": "'<!-- **bold** _italic_ and [a link](https://example.com) inside a comment -->\\n'",
  "md4w:comment-with-raw-html": "'<!-- <div class=\"x\">raw tags</div> and <script>alert(1)</script> inside -->\\n'",
  "md4w:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:div-markdown-attr": "'<div markdown=\"1\">\\n*does markdown=\"1\" change anything?*\\n</div>\\n'",
  "md4w:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></p>\\n'",
  "md4w:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open <span>span</span> still emphasized</em></p>\\n'",
  "md4w:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language\\n</code></pre>\\n'",
  "md4w:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"language-js\">const x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);\\n</code></pre>\\n'",
  "md4w:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.[^1]</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>[^1]: This is the footnote definition.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference[^a] and second reference[^b] in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>[^a]: First footnote.\\n' +\n  '[^b]: Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash<br>\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces<br>\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  '<h1>a heading <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"a-heading\" href=\"#a-heading\"></a></h1>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n'",
  "md4w:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n# not a heading\\n</div>\\n'",
  "md4w:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"a-heading-that-gets-an-anchor\" href=\"#a-heading-that-gets-an-anchor\"></a></h2>\\n' +\n  '<p>Some text under the heading.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>\\n'",
  "md4w:html-inside-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Tag</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Example</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>bold</td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>hi</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>break</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a<br>b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\"></p>\\n'",
  "md4w:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\nsecond line</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:inline-html": "'<p>Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:list-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>a list item</li>\\n<li>another list item</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>\\n'",
  "md4w:list-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n</div>\\n'",
  "md4w:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>A list item containing</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Next item</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "md4w:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>First step:</p>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">echo hello\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Second step after the code block.</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "md4w:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Item one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Item two with a blank line before it</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "md4w:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>\\n'",
  "md4w:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\ncontent\\n</div>\\n*not emphasized — still in the HTML block*\\n'",
  "md4w:md-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n</div>\\n'",
  "md4w:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n</div>\\n'",
  "md4w:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code><em>emphasized inside a code tag</em></code> here.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n</pre>\\n'",
  "md4w:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td>*not emphasized* in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright &copy; less-than &lt; and a non-entity &nbsp;.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "md4w:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "md4w:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "md4w:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal &#35; and hex &#x263A; entities.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "md4w:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "md4w:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- this is an HTML comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-one\" href=\"#heading-one\"></a></h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading two <a class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"heading-two\" href=\"#heading-two\"></a></h2>\\n'",
  "md4w:setext-vs-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>item</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr>\\n'",
  "md4w:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote &quot; in plain text.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></p>\\n'",
  "md4w:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is <del>single tilde</del> text.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:table-alignment": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"left\">Left</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"center\">Center</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"right\">Right</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">b</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">dd</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">ee</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">ff</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:table-basic": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Fruit</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Color</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Apple</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Red</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Lime</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Green</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Column</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Value</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>pipe</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a | b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:table-inline-formatting": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Syntax</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Renders</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>code</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>bold</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><del>old</del></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:table-no-body": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:table-ragged": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>C</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>only one</td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>1</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>2</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>3</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>\\n'",
  "md4w:tagfilter": "'<p>A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:tasklist": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked disabled>Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled>Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked disabled>Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "md4w:tasklist-nested": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled>Parent task<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked disabled>Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled>Child todo</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "md4w:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked disabled>Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled>Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "md4w:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr>\\n<p>Below</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>loose one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>loose two</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "md4w:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>\\n'",
  "md4w:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>\\n'",
  "micro-down:alert-caution": "'<blockquote>[!CAUTION]\\n' +\n  'Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</blockquote>'",
  "micro-down:alert-important": "'<blockquote>[!IMPORTANT]\\n' +\n  'Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</blockquote>'",
  "micro-down:alert-note": "'<blockquote>[!NOTE]\\n' +\n  'Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</blockquote>'",
  "micro-down:alert-tip": "'<blockquote>[!TIP]\\n' +\n  'Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</blockquote>'",
  "micro-down:alert-warning": "'<blockquote>[!WARNING]\\n' +\n  'Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</blockquote>'",
  "micro-down:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&b=2&c=3\" >query link</a> with ampersands.</p>'",
  "micro-down:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading 2</h2>\\n' +\n  '<h3>Heading 3</h3>\\n' +\n  '<h4>Heading 4</h4>\\n' +\n  '<h5>Heading 5</h5>\\n' +\n  '<h6>Heading 6</h6>'",
  "micro-down:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at someone@example.com please.</p>'",
  "micro-down:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link www.example.com/foo_(bar) with balanced parens.</p>'",
  "micro-down:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (<a href=\"https://example.com)\">https://example.com)</a> and <a href=\"https://example.com.\">https://example.com.</a> and <a href=\"https://example.com/path\">https://example.com/path</a>?a=1&b=2.</p>'",
  "micro-down:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> for more, or <a href=\"http://test.org\">http://test.org</a> too.</p>'",
  "micro-down:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out www.example.com for details.</p>'",
  "micro-down:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>'",
  "micro-down:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code></code> code with <code> backtick </code><code> and </code><code></code>triple <code> inside</code><code></code>.</p>'",
  "micro-down:blockquote": "'<blockquote>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</blockquote>'",
  "micro-down:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote># Heading inside a quote\\n\\nAnd a paragraph.</blockquote>'",
  "micro-down:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote><div>\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized inside quoted div</em>\\n' +\n  '</div></blockquote>'",
  "micro-down:code-block-with-html": "'<pre class=\"html\">&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</pre>'",
  "micro-down:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code></code> a <code> b </code>` for literal backticks.</p>'",
  "micro-down:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text</h1><!-- trailing comment -->'",
  "micro-down:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table><tr><td>Code</td><td>Note</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>----</td><td>----</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>`</td></tr></table><!-- c --><p>` | literal |</p>'",
  "micro-down:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p><!-- a standalone block comment --><p>After the comment.</p>'",
