  "micromark:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n<p>Some text under the heading.</p>'",
  "micromark:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>'",
  "micromark:html-inside-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Tag</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Example</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>bold</td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>hi</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>break</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a<br>b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "micromark:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\" /></p>'",
  "micromark:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\nsecond line</p>'",
  "micromark:inline-html": "'<p>Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.</p>'",
  "micromark:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>'",
  "micromark:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>'",
  "micromark:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>'",
  "micromark:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>'",
  "micromark:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>'",
  "micromark:list-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>a list item</li>\\n<li>another list item</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>'",
  "micromark:list-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n</div>'",
  "micromark:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>A list item containing</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Next item</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "micromark:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>First step:</p>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">echo hello\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Second step after the code block.</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "micromark:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item two with a blank line before it</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "micromark:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>'",
  "micromark:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>'",
  "micromark:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>'",
  "micromark:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\ncontent\\n</div>\\n*not emphasized — still in the HTML block*'",
  "micromark:md-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n</div>'",
  "micromark:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n</div>'",
  "micromark:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code><em>emphasized inside a code tag</em></code> here.</p>'",
  "micromark:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.</p>'",
  "micromark:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n</pre>'",
  "micromark:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td>*not emphasized* in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>'",
  "micromark:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>'",
  "micromark:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>'",
  "micromark:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright © less-than &lt; and a non-entity  .</p>'",
  "micromark:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "micromark:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "micromark:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "micromark:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal # and hex ☺ entities.</p>'",
  "micromark:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>'",
  "micromark:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>'",
  "micromark:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>'",
  "micromark:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>'",
  "micromark:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- this is an HTML comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>'",
  "micromark:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "micromark:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1>\\n<h2>Heading two</h2>'",
  "micromark:setext-vs-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>item</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr />'",
  "micromark:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote &quot; in plain text.</p>'",
  "micromark:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>'",
  "micromark:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></p>'",
  "micromark:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is <del>single tilde</del> text.</p>'",
  "micromark:table-alignment": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"left\">Left</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"center\">Center</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"right\">Right</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">b</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">dd</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">ee</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">ff</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "micromark:table-basic": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Fruit</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Color</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Apple</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Red</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Lime</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Green</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "micromark:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Column</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Value</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>pipe</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a | b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "micromark:table-inline-formatting": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Syntax</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Renders</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>code</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>bold</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><del>old</del></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "micromark:table-no-body": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "micromark:table-ragged": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>C</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>only one</td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>1</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>2</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>3</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "micromark:tagfilter": "'<p>A &lt;title> tag and a &lt;textarea> and &lt;xmp> and &lt;script>alert(1)&lt;/script> raw.</p>'",
  "micromark:tasklist": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "micromark:tasklist-nested": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> Parent task\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> Child todo</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "micromark:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "micromark:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr />\\n<p>Below</p>'",
  "micromark:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose two</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "micromark:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>'",
  "micromark:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:alert-caution": "'<p>> [!CAUTION]\\n' +\n  '> Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:alert-important": "'<p>> [!IMPORTANT]\\n' +\n  '> Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:alert-note": "'<p>> [!NOTE]\\n' +\n  '> Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:alert-tip": "'<p>> [!TIP]\\n> Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:alert-warning": "'<p>> [!WARNING]\\n' +\n  '> Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&b=2&c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1><h2>Heading 2</h2><h3>Heading 3</h3><h4>Heading 4</h4><h5>Heading 5</h5><h6>Heading 6</h6>'",
  "nano-markdown:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at someone@example.com please.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link www.example.com/foo_(bar) with balanced parens.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (https://example.com) and https://example.com. and https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit https://example.com for more, or http://test.org too.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out www.example.com for details.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and \\\\`not code\\\\` and # not heading and [not link]</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline `` code with ` backtick `` and ```triple ` inside```.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:blockquote": "'<p>> A blockquote\\n> spanning two lines.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:blockquote-with-heading": "'<p>> # Heading inside a quote\\n>\\n> And a paragraph.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<p>> <div>\\n> <i>not emphasized inside quoted div</i>\\n> </div></p>'",
  "nano-markdown:code-block-with-html": "'<p>```html\\n<div class=\"x\">\\n  <script>alert(1)</script>\\n</div>\\n```</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:code-span": "'<p>Use the `printf()` function and `` a ` b `` for literal backticks.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text <!-- trailing comment --></h1>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<p>| Code | Note |\\n| ---- | ---- |\\n| `<!-- c -->` | literal |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p><!-- a standalone block comment --></p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>After the comment.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code `<!-- not a real comment -->` must stay literal.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<p>```html\\n<!-- comment inside a fenced code block -->\\n<div>x</div>\\n```</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-in-indented-code": "'<p><!-- comment inside an indented code block -->\\n    still code</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-in-list": "'<ul><li>First item\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items --></li><li>Second item</li></ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-in-table-cell": "'<p>| Col A | Col B |\\n' +\n  '| ----- | ----- |\\n' +\n  '| <!-- raw comment --> | visible |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-multiline": "'<p><!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n--></p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-only": "'<p><!-- the entire document is only this comment --></p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<p>| A | B |\\n| - | - |\\n| <!-- a | b --> | c |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then <!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>'",
