  "nano-markdown:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo*bar*baz and foo_bar_baz and 5*6*7</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation\">Wikipedia</a>) article.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:list-in-div-loose": "'<p><div></p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<ul><li>a list item</li><li>another list item</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p></div></p>'",
  "nano-markdown:list-in-div-tight": "'<p><div></p><ul><li>not a list item</li><li>still not a list\\n' +\n  '</div></li></ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul><li>A list item containing</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>  > a blockquote\\n' +\n  '  > inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<ul><li>Next item</li></ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol><li>First step:</li></ol>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>   ```bash\\n' +\n  '   echo hello\\n' +\n  '   ```</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<ol><li>Second step after the code block.</li></ol>'",
  "nano-markdown:loose-list": "'<ul><li>Item one</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<ul><li>Item two with a blank line before it</li></ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<p><div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div></p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p><i>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</i></p>'",
