  "nano-markdown:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code><i>emphasized inside a code tag</i></code> here.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><i>emphasized</i> and <b>bold</b></span> stay markdown.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:md-in-pre": "'<p><pre>\\n<i>not emphasized</i> and # not a heading\\n</pre></p>'",
  "nano-markdown:md-in-table-html": "'<p><table>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td><i>not emphasized</i> in a raw table</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</table></p>'",
  "nano-markdown:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright &copy; less-than &lt; and a non-entity &nbsp;.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:nested-blockquote": "'<p>> Outer\\n> > Inner nested\\n> > quote</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:nested-list": "'<ul><li>Top<ul><li>Nested one</li><li>Nested two<ul><li>Deeper</li></ul></li></ul></li><li>Back to top</li></ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol><li>Ordered parent<ul><li>Unordered child<ol><li>Ordered grandchild</li></ol></li><li>Another child</li></ul></li></ol>'",
  "nano-markdown:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal &#35; and hex &#x263A; entities.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:ordered-list": "'<ol><li>First</li><li>Second</li><li>Third</li></ol>'",
  "nano-markdown:ordered-list-start": "'<ol><li>Five</li><li>Six</li><li>Seven</li></ol>'",
  "nano-markdown:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <https://example.com> and email <test@example.com>.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p><!-- this is an HTML comment --></p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:reference-link": "'<p>A [reference link][ref] in text.</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>[ref]: https://example.com \"Reference\"</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:setext-headings": "'<p>Heading one\\n===========</p>\\n\\n<p>Heading two</p><hr/>'",
  "nano-markdown:setext-vs-list": "'<ul><li>item</li></ul><hr/>'",
  "nano-markdown:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than < and greater-than > and ampersand & and quote \" in plain text.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <i>*bold</i>* and <i>italic</i> inside</del></p>'",
  "nano-markdown:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is ~single tilde~ text.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:table-alignment": "'<p>| Left | Center | Right |\\n' +\n  '| :--- | :----: | ----: |\\n' +\n  '| a    | b      | c     |\\n' +\n  '| dd   | ee     | ff    |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:table-basic": "'<p>| Fruit | Color |\\n| ----- | ----- |\\n| Apple | Red |\\n| Lime  | Green |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:table-escaped-pipe": "'<p>| Column | Value |\\n| ------ | ----- |\\n| pipe   | a \\\\| b |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:table-inline-formatting": "'<p>| Syntax | Renders |\\n' +\n  '| ------ | ------- |\\n' +\n  '| `code` | <b>bold</b> |\\n' +\n  '| <del>old</del> | <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a> |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:table-no-body": "'<p>| Header A | Header B |\\n| -------- | -------- |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:table-ragged": "'<p>| A | B | C |\\n| - | - | - |\\n| only one |\\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 |</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:tagfilter": "'<p>A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:tasklist": "'<ul><li>[x] Completed task</li><li>[ ] Incomplete task</li><li>[X] Capital X also checked</li></ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:tasklist-nested": "'<ul><li>[ ] Parent task<ul><li>[x] Child done</li><li>[ ] Child todo</li></ul></li></ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul><li>[x] Task with <b>bold</b> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li><li>[ ] Task with `code`</li></ul>'",
  "nano-markdown:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n\\n<hr/>\\n\\n<p>Below</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul><li>tight one</li><li>tight two</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<ol><li>loose one</li></ol>\\n' +\n  '\\n' +\n  '<ol><li>loose two</li></ol>'",
  "nano-markdown:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>'",
  "nano-markdown:unordered-list": "'<ul><li>Apple</li><li>Banana</li><li>Cherry</li></ul>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:alert-caution": "'<blockquote class=\"markdown-alert-caution\">\\n' +\n  '<p>Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:alert-important": "'<blockquote class=\"markdown-alert-important\">\\n' +\n  '<p>Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:alert-note": "'<blockquote class=\"markdown-alert-note\">\\n' +\n  '<p>Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:alert-tip": "'<blockquote class=\"markdown-alert-tip\">\\n' +\n  '<p>Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:alert-warning": "'<blockquote class=\"markdown-alert-warning\">\\n' +\n  '<p>Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&amp;b=2&amp;c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading 2</h2>\\n' +\n  '<h3>Heading 3</h3>\\n' +\n  '<h4>Heading 4</h4>\\n' +\n  '<h5>Heading 5</h5>\\n' +\n  '<h6>Heading 6</h6>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at someone@example.com please.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link www.example.com/foo_(bar) with balanced parens.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (https://example.com) and https://example.com. and https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit https://example.com for more, or http://test.org too.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out www.example.com for details.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code>code with ` backtick</code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n<p>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<h1>Heading inside a quote</h1>\\n' +\n  '<p>And a paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote>\\n<div>\\n*not emphasized inside quoted div*\\n</div></blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=\"x\"&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code>a ` b</code> for literal backticks.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text <!-- trailing comment --></h1>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td><code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code></td><td>literal</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- a standalone block comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After the comment.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-in-indented-code": "'<!-- comment inside an indented code block -->\\n' +\n  '<pre><code>still code</code></pre>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-in-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>First item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items -->\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Second item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table><thead><tr><th>Col A</th><th>Col B</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td><!-- raw comment --></td><td>visible</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-multiline": "'<!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n-->'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-only": "'<!-- the entire document is only this comment -->'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<table><thead><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>&lt;!-- a</td><td>b --&gt;</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-with-markdown": "'<!-- **bold** _italic_ and [a link](https://example.com) inside a comment -->'",
  "pulldown-cmark:comment-with-raw-html": "'<!-- <div class=\"x\">raw tags</div> and <script>alert(1)</script> inside -->'",
  "pulldown-cmark:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:div-markdown-attr": "'<div markdown=\"1\">\\n*does markdown=\"1\" change anything?*\\n</div>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open <span>span</span> still emphasized</em></p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language\\n</code></pre>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"language-js\">const x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);\\n</code></pre>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.<sup class=\"footnote-reference\"><a href=\"#1\">1</a></sup></p>\\n' +\n  '<div class=\"footnote-definition\" id=\"1\"><sup class=\"footnote-definition-label\">1</sup>\\n' +\n  '<p>This is the footnote definition.</p>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference<sup class=\"footnote-reference\"><a href=\"#a\">1</a></sup> and second reference<sup class=\"footnote-reference\"><a href=\"#b\">2</a></sup> in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '<div class=\"footnote-definition\" id=\"a\"><sup class=\"footnote-definition-label\">1</sup>\\n' +\n  '<p>First footnote.</p>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n' +\n  '<div class=\"footnote-definition\" id=\"b\"><sup class=\"footnote-definition-label\">2</sup>\\n' +\n  '<p>Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>.</p>\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash<br />\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces<br />\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<h1>a heading</h1>\\n</div>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n# not a heading\\n</div>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n<p>Some text under the heading.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:html-inside-table": "'<table><thead><tr><th>Tag</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>bold</td><td><strong>hi</strong></td></tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>break</td><td>a<br>b</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\" /></p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\nsecond line</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:inline-html": "'<p>Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:list-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>a list item</li>\\n<li>another list item</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:list-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n</div>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>A list item containing</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Next item</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>First step:</p>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">echo hello\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Second step after the code block.</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item two with a blank line before it</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\ncontent\\n</div>\\n*not emphasized — still in the HTML block*'",
  "pulldown-cmark:md-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n</div>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n</div>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code><em>emphasized inside a code tag</em></code> here.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n</pre>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td>*not emphasized* in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>'",
  "pulldown-cmark:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright © less-than &lt; and a non-entity  .</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal # and hex ☺ entities.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- this is an HTML comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1>\\n<h2>Heading two</h2>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:setext-vs-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>item</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr />\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote \" in plain text.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is <del>single tilde</del> text.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:table-alignment": "'<table><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align: left\">Left</th><th style=\"text-align: center\">Center</th><th style=\"text-align: right\">Right</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td style=\"text-align: left\">a</td><td style=\"text-align: center\">b</td><td style=\"text-align: right\">c</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td style=\"text-align: left\">dd</td><td style=\"text-align: center\">ee</td><td style=\"text-align: right\">ff</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:table-basic": "'<table><thead><tr><th>Fruit</th><th>Color</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>Apple</td><td>Red</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>Lime</td><td>Green</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table><thead><tr><th>Column</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>pipe</td><td>a | b</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:table-inline-formatting": "'<table><thead><tr><th>Syntax</th><th>Renders</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td><code>code</code></td><td><strong>bold</strong></td></tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td><del>old</del></td><td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:table-no-body": "'<table><thead><tr><th>Header A</th><th>Header B</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:table-ragged": "'<table><thead><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th></tr></thead><tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>only one</td><td></td><td></td></tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody></table>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:tagfilter": "'<p>A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:tasklist": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/>\\n' +\n  'Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\\n' +\n  'Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/>\\n' +\n  'Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:tasklist-nested": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\\n' +\n  'Parent task\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/>\\n' +\n  'Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\\n' +\n  'Child todo</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/>\\n' +\n  'Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\\n' +\n  'Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr />\\n<p>Below</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose two</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>\\n'",
  "pulldown-cmark:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>\\n'",
  "remark-rehype:alert-caution": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!CAUTION]\\n' +\n  'Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:alert-important": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!IMPORTANT]\\n' +\n  'Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:alert-note": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!NOTE]\\n' +\n  'Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:alert-tip": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!TIP]\\n' +\n  'Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:alert-warning": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>[!WARNING]\\n' +\n  'Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&#x26;b=2&#x26;c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2>Heading 2</h2>\\n' +\n  '<h3>Heading 3</h3>\\n' +\n  '<h4>Heading 4</h4>\\n' +\n  '<h5>Heading 5</h5>\\n' +\n  '<h6>Heading 6</h6>'",
  "remark-rehype:autolink-email": "'<p>Email me at <a href=\"mailto:someone@example.com\">someone@example.com</a> please.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link <a href=\"http://www.example.com/foo_(bar)\">www.example.com/foo_(bar)</a> with balanced parens.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (<a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>) and <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>. and <a href=\"https://example.com/path?a=1&#x26;b=2\">https://example.com/path?a=1&#x26;b=2</a>.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> for more, or <a href=\"http://test.org\">http://test.org</a> too.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out <a href=\"http://www.example.com\">www.example.com</a> for details.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code>code with ` backtick</code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n<p>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</p>\\n</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<h1>Heading inside a quote</h1>\\n' +\n  '<p>And a paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote>\\n<div>\\n*not emphasized inside quoted div*\\n</div>\\n</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&#x3C;div class=\"x\">\\n' +\n  '  &#x3C;script>alert(1)&#x3C;/script>\\n' +\n  '&#x3C;/div>\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "remark-rehype:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code>a ` b</code> for literal backticks.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text <!-- trailing comment --></h1>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Code</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Note</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>&#x3C;!-- c --></code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>literal</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- a standalone block comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After the comment.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&#x3C;!-- not a real comment --></code> must stay literal.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&#x3C;!-- comment inside a fenced code block -->\\n' +\n  '&#x3C;div>x&#x3C;/div>\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-in-indented-code": "'<!-- comment inside an indented code block -->\\n' +\n  '<pre><code>still code\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-in-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>First item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items -->\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Second item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Col B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><!-- raw comment --></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>visible</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-multiline": "'<!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n-->'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-only": "'<!-- the entire document is only this comment -->'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>&#x3C;!-- a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>b --></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &#x3C;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-with-markdown": "'<!-- **bold** _italic_ and [a link](https://example.com) inside a comment -->'",
  "remark-rehype:comment-with-raw-html": "'<!-- <div class=\"x\">raw tags</div> and <script>alert(1)</script> inside -->'",
  "remark-rehype:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:div-markdown-attr": "'<div markdown=\"1\">\\n*does markdown=\"1\" change anything?*\\n</div>'",
  "remark-rehype:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></p>'",
  "remark-rehype:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open <span>span</span> still emphasized</em></p>'",
  "remark-rehype:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language\\n</code></pre>'",
  "remark-rehype:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"language-js\">const x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);\\n</code></pre>'",
  "remark-rehype:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup></p>\\n' +\n  '<section data-footnotes class=\"footnotes\"><h2 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"footnote-label\">Footnotes</h2>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"user-content-fn-1\">\\n' +\n  '<p>This is the footnote definition. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</section>'",
  "remark-rehype:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-a\" id=\"user-content-fnref-a\" data-footnote-ref aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup> and second reference<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-b\" id=\"user-content-fnref-b\" data-footnote-ref aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">2</a></sup> in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '<section data-footnotes class=\"footnotes\"><h2 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"footnote-label\">Footnotes</h2>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"user-content-fn-a\">\\n' +\n  '<p>First footnote. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-a\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li id=\"user-content-fn-b\">\\n' +\n  '<p>Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-b\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</section>'",
  "remark-rehype:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash<br>\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces<br>\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<h1>a heading</h1>\\n</div>'",
  "remark-rehype:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n# not a heading\\n</div>'",
  "remark-rehype:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n<p>Some text under the heading.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>'",
  "remark-rehype:html-inside-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Tag</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Example</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>bold</td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>hi</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>break</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a<br>b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\"></p>'",
  "remark-rehype:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block\\nsecond line</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:inline-html": "'<p>Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:list-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>a list item</li>\\n<li>another list item</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>'",
  "remark-rehype:list-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n</div>'",
  "remark-rehype:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>A list item containing</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Next item</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "remark-rehype:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>First step:</p>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">echo hello\\n' +\n  '</code></pre>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Second step after the code block.</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "remark-rehype:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>Item two with a blank line before it</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "remark-rehype:math-block": "'<p>$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>'",
  "remark-rehype:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\ncontent\\n</div>\\n*not emphasized — still in the HTML block*'",
  "remark-rehype:md-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n<p><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></p>\\n</div>'",
  "remark-rehype:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n</div>'",
  "remark-rehype:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code><em>emphasized inside a code tag</em></code> here.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n</pre>'",
  "remark-rehype:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td>*not emphasized* in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:mention": "'<p>Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &#x26; copyright © less-than &#x3C; and a non-entity  .</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<p>Inner nested\\n' +\n  'quote</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "remark-rehype:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "remark-rehype:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "remark-rehype:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal # and hex ☺ entities.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>'",
  "remark-rehype:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>'",
  "remark-rehype:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:pointy-autolink": "'<p>Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- this is an HTML comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1>\\n<h2>Heading two</h2>'",
  "remark-rehype:setext-vs-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>item</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr>'",
  "remark-rehype:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than &#x3C; and greater-than > and ampersand &#x26; and quote \" in plain text.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></p>'",
  "remark-rehype:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is <del>single tilde</del> text.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:table-alignment": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"left\">Left</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"center\">Center</th>\\n' +\n  '<th align=\"right\">Right</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">b</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"left\">dd</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"center\">ee</td>\\n' +\n  '<td align=\"right\">ff</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:table-basic": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Fruit</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Color</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Apple</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Red</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Lime</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Green</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Column</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Value</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>pipe</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a | b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:table-inline-formatting": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Syntax</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Renders</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>code</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>bold</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><del>old</del></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:table-no-body": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>Header B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:table-ragged": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th>A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>B</th>\\n' +\n  '<th>C</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>only one</td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '<td></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>1</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>2</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>3</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "remark-rehype:tagfilter": "'<p>A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:tasklist": "'<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "remark-rehype:tasklist-nested": "'<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Parent task\\n' +\n  '<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Child todo</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "remark-rehype:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "remark-rehype:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr>\\n<p>Below</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose one</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>\\n' +\n  '<p>loose two</p>\\n' +\n  '</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "remark-rehype:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>'",
  "remark-rehype:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>'",
  "showdown:alert-caution": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <p>[!CAUTION]<br />\\n' +\n  '  Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:alert-important": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <p>[!IMPORTANT]<br />\\n' +\n  '  Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:alert-note": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <p>[!NOTE]<br />\\n' +\n  '  Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:alert-tip": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <p>[!TIP]<br />\\n' +\n  '  Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:alert-warning": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <p>[!WARNING]<br />\\n' +\n  '  Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:ampersand-in-url": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&b=2&c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</p>'",
  "showdown:atx-headings": "'<h1 id=\"heading-1\">Heading 1</h1>\\n' +\n  '<h2 id=\"heading-2\">Heading 2</h2>\\n' +\n  '<h3 id=\"heading-3\">Heading 3</h3>\\n' +\n  '<h4 id=\"heading-4\">Heading 4</h4>\\n' +\n  '<h5 id=\"heading-5\">Heading 5</h5>\\n' +\n  '<h6 id=\"heading-6\">Heading 6</h6>'",
  "showdown:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<p>A link <a href=\"http://www.example.com/foo_(bar\">www.example.com/foo_(bar</a>) with balanced parens.</p>'",
  "showdown:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<p>See (<a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>) and <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>. and <a href=\"https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2\">https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2</a>.</p>'",
  "showdown:autolink-url": "'<p>Visit <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> for more, or <a href=\"http://test.org\">http://test.org</a> too.</p>'",
  "showdown:autolink-www": "'<p>Check out <a href=\"http://www.example.com\">www.example.com</a> for details.</p>'",
  "showdown:backslash-escapes": "'<p>*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</p>'",
  "showdown:backtick-in-code": "'<p>Inline <code>code with ` backtick</code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</p>'",
  "showdown:blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n  <p>A blockquote<br />\\n  spanning two lines.</p>\\n</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <h1 id=\"heading-inside-a-quote\">Heading inside a quote</h1>\\n' +\n  '  <p>And a paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <div>\\n' +\n  '  *not emphasized inside quoted div*\\n' +\n  '  </div>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"html language-html\">&lt;div class=\"x\"&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>'",
  "showdown:code-span": "'<p>Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code>a ` b</code> for literal backticks.</p>'",
  "showdown:comment-after-heading": "'<h1 id=\"heading-text----trailing-comment---\">Heading text <!-- trailing comment --></h1>'",
  "showdown:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"code\">Code</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"note\">Note</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>literal</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "showdown:comment-block": "'<p>Before the comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- a standalone block comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After the comment.</p>'",
  "showdown:comment-in-code-span": "'<p>Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</p>'",
  "showdown:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"html language-html\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>'",
  "showdown:comment-in-indented-code": "'<!-- comment inside an indented code block -->\\n' +\n  '<pre><code>still code</code></pre>'",
  "showdown:comment-in-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>First item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items -->\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Second item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "showdown:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"col_a\">Col A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"col_b\">Col B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><!-- raw comment --></td>\\n' +\n  '<td>visible</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "showdown:comment-inline": "'<p>Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.</p>'",
  "showdown:comment-multiline": "'<!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n-->'",
  "showdown:comment-only": "'<!-- the entire document is only this comment -->'",
  "showdown:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<p>| A | B |<br />\\n| - | - |<br />\\n| <!-- a | b --> | c |</p>'",
  "showdown:comment-unclosed": "'<p>Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</p>'",
  "showdown:comment-with-markdown": "'<!-- **bold** _italic_ and [a link](https://example.com) inside a comment -->'",
  "showdown:comment-with-raw-html": "'<!-- <div class=\"x\">raw tags</div> and <script>alert(1)</script> inside -->'",
  "showdown:consecutive-emphasis": "'<p><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</p>'",
  "showdown:div-markdown-attr": "'<div markdown=\"1\"><p><em>does markdown=\"1\" change anything?</em></p></div>'",
  "showdown:emoji-shortcode": "'<p>Shipped it 🚀 and celebrated 🎉 with 👍.</p>'",
  "showdown:emphasis": "'<p><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong><em>bold italic</em></strong></p>'",
  "showdown:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<p><em>open <span>span</span> still emphasized</em></p>'",
  "showdown:emphasis-in-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</p>'",
  "showdown:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<p>Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</p>'",
  "showdown:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language</code></pre>'",
  "showdown:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"js language-js\">const x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);</code></pre>'",
  "showdown:footnote": "'<p>Here is a statement with a footnote.[^1]</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>[^1]: This is the footnote definition.</p>'",
  "showdown:footnote-multiple": "'<p>First reference[^a] and second reference[^b] in one paragraph.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>[^a]: First footnote.<br />\\n' +\n  '[^b]: Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>.</p>'",
  "showdown:hard-break-backslash": "'<p>Line one with a backslash\\\\<br />\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>'",
  "showdown:hard-break-spaces": "'<p>Line one with trailing spaces  <br />\\nLine two after a hard break.</p>'",
  "showdown:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n\\n# a heading\\n\\n</div>'",
  "showdown:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n# not a heading\\n</div>'",
  "showdown:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2 id=\"a-heading-that-gets-an-anchor\">A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>\\n' +\n  '<p>Some text under the heading.</p>'",
  "showdown:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>'",
  "showdown:html-inside-table": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"tag\">Tag</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"example\">Example</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>bold</td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>hi</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>break</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a<br>b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "showdown:image": "'<p><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\" /></p>'",
  "showdown:indented-code": "'<p>indented code block<br />\\n    second line</p>'",
  "showdown:inline-html": "'<p>Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.</p>'",
  "showdown:inline-link": "'<p>An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</p>'",
  "showdown:intraword-emphasis": "'<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</p>'",
  "showdown:issue-reference": "'<p>Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</p>'",
  "showdown:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</p>'",
  "showdown:link-with-title": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</p>'",
  "showdown:list-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n\\n- a list item\\n- another list item\\n\\n</div>'",
  "showdown:list-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n- not a list item\\n- still not a list\\n</div>'",
  "showdown:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>A list item containing</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <p>a blockquote<br />\\n' +\n  '  inside the item</p>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>\\n' +\n  '<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Next item</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "showdown:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>First step:</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>\\n' +\n  '<pre><code class=\"bash language-bash\">   echo hello</code></pre>\\n' +\n  '<ol start=\"2\">\\n' +\n  '<li>Second step after the code block.</li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "showdown:loose-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Item one</p></li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>Item two with a blank line before it</p></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "showdown:math-block": "'<p>$$<br />\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i<br />\\n$$</p>'",
  "showdown:math-inline": "'<p>The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</p>'",
  "showdown:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n' +\n  '<p><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></p>'",
  "showdown:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div>\\n' +\n  '<p><em>not emphasized — still in the HTML block</em></p>'",
  "showdown:md-in-div-loose": "'<div>\\n\\n*emphasized* and **bold**\\n\\n</div>'",
  "showdown:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n*not emphasized* and **not bold**\\n</div>'",
  "showdown:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<p>Inline <code>*emphasized inside a code tag*</code> here.</p>'",
  "showdown:md-in-inline-span": "'<p>Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.</p>'",
  "showdown:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n*not emphasized* and # not a heading\\n</pre>'",
  "showdown:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td>*not emphasized* in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>'",
  "showdown:mention": "'<p>Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/octocat\">@octocat</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/github\">@github</a> for the help.</p>'",
  "showdown:multiple-blank-lines": "'<p>Paragraph one.</p>\\n<p>Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</p>'",
  "showdown:named-entity": "'<p>Ampersand &amp; copyright &copy; less-than &lt; and a non-entity &nbsp;.</p>'",
  "showdown:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>\\n' +\n  '  <p>Outer</p>\\n' +\n  '  <blockquote>\\n' +\n  '    <p>Inner nested<br />\\n' +\n  '    quote</p>\\n' +\n  '  </blockquote>\\n' +\n  '</blockquote>'",
  "showdown:nested-list": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Top<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Nested two</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Deeper</li></ul></li>\\n' +\n  '<li>Back to top</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "showdown:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered parent<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Unordered child</li></ul><ol>\\n' +\n  '<li>Ordered grandchild</li></ol><ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>Another child</li></ul></li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "showdown:numeric-entity": "'<p>Decimal &#35; and hex &#x263A; entities.</p>'",
  "showdown:ordered-list": "'<ol>\\n<li>First</li>\\n<li>Second</li>\\n<li>Third</li>\\n</ol>'",
  "showdown:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\">\\n<li>Five</li>\\n<li>Six</li>\\n<li>Seven</li>\\n</ol>'",
  "showdown:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<p>First line of a paragraph<br />\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</p>\\n' +\n  '<p>A second paragraph.</p>'",
  "showdown:raw-html-comment": "'<p>Before comment.</p>\\n' +\n  '<!-- this is an HTML comment -->\\n' +\n  '<p>After comment.</p>'",
  "showdown:reference-link": "'<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</p>'",
  "showdown:setext-headings": "'<h1 id=\"heading-one\">Heading one</h1>\\n<h2 id=\"heading-two\">Heading two</h2>'",
  "showdown:setext-vs-list": "'<h2 id=\"--item\">- item</h2>'",
  "showdown:special-chars-in-text": "'<p>Less-than < and greater-than > and ampersand &amp; and quote \" in plain text.</p>'",
  "showdown:strikethrough-double": "'<p>This is <del>struck through</del> text.</p>'",
  "showdown:strikethrough-nested": "'<p><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></p>'",
  "showdown:strikethrough-single": "'<p>This is ~single tilde~ text.</p>'",
  "showdown:table-alignment": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\">Left</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">Center</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Right</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:left;\">a</td>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:center;\">b</td>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:right;\">c</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:left;\">dd</td>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:center;\">ee</td>\\n' +\n  '<td style=\"text-align:right;\">ff</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "showdown:table-basic": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"fruit\">Fruit</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"color\">Color</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Apple</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Red</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>Lime</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>Green</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "showdown:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"column\">Column</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"value\">Value</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td>pipe</td>\\n' +\n  '<td>a | b</td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "showdown:table-inline-formatting": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"syntax\">Syntax</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"renders\">Renders</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><code>code</code></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><strong>bold</strong></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<td><del>old</del></td>\\n' +\n  '<td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "showdown:table-no-body": "'<table>\\n' +\n  '<thead>\\n' +\n  '<tr>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"header_a\">Header A</th>\\n' +\n  '<th id=\"header_b\">Header B</th>\\n' +\n  '</tr>\\n' +\n  '</thead>\\n' +\n  '<tbody>\\n' +\n  '</tbody>\\n' +\n  '</table>'",
  "showdown:table-ragged": "'<p>| A | B | C |<br />\\n' +\n  '| - | - | - |<br />\\n' +\n  '| only one |<br />\\n' +\n  '| 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 |</p>'",
  "showdown:tagfilter": "'<p>A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.</p>'",
  "showdown:tasklist": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled style=\"margin: 0px 0.35em 0.25em -1.6em; vertical-align: middle;\" checked> Completed task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled style=\"margin: 0px 0.35em 0.25em -1.6em; vertical-align: middle;\"> Incomplete task</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled style=\"margin: 0px 0.35em 0.25em -1.6em; vertical-align: middle;\" checked> Capital X also checked</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "showdown:tasklist-nested": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled style=\"margin: 0px 0.35em 0.25em -1.6em; vertical-align: middle;\"> Parent task<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled style=\"margin: 0px 0.35em 0.25em -1.6em; vertical-align: middle;\" checked> Child done</li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled style=\"margin: 0px 0.35em 0.25em -1.6em; vertical-align: middle;\"> Child todo</li></ul></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "showdown:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled style=\"margin: 0px 0.35em 0.25em -1.6em; vertical-align: middle;\" checked> Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li>\\n' +\n  '<li class=\"task-list-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled style=\"margin: 0px 0.35em 0.25em -1.6em; vertical-align: middle;\"> Task with <code>code</code></li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>'",
  "showdown:thematic-break": "'<p>Above</p>\\n<hr />\\n<p>Below</p>'",
  "showdown:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight one</li>\\n' +\n  '<li>tight two</li>\\n' +\n  '</ul>\\n' +\n  '<p>paragraph between</p>\\n' +\n  '<ol>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>loose one</p></li>\\n' +\n  '<li><p>loose two</p></li>\\n' +\n  '</ol>'",
  "showdown:unicode-text": "'<p>Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</p>'",
  "showdown:unordered-list": "'<ul>\\n<li>Apple</li>\\n<li>Banana</li>\\n<li>Cherry</li>\\n</ul>'",
  "simple-markdown:alert-caution": "'<blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">[!CAUTION]\\n' +\n  'Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:alert-important": "'<blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">[!IMPORTANT]\\n' +\n  'Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:alert-note": "'<blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">[!NOTE]\\n' +\n  'Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:alert-tip": "'<blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">[!TIP]\\n' +\n  'Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:alert-warning": "'<blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">[!WARNING]\\n' +\n  'Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:ampersand-in-url": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&amp;b=2&amp;c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:atx-headings": "'<div class=\"paragraph\"># Heading 1\\n' +\n  '## Heading 2\\n' +\n  '### Heading 3\\n' +\n  '#### Heading 4\\n' +\n  '##### Heading 5\\n' +\n  '###### Heading 6</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:autolink-email": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Email me at someone@example.com please.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:autolink-in-parentheses": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">A link www.example.com/foo_(bar) with balanced parens.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">See (<a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>) and <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>. and <a href=\"https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2\">https://example.com/path?a=1&amp;b=2</a>.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:autolink-url": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Visit <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> for more, or <a href=\"http://test.org\">http://test.org</a> too.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:autolink-www": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Check out www.example.com for details.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:backslash-escapes": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">*not emphasis* and `not code` and # not heading and [not link]</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:backtick-in-code": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Inline <code> code with ` backtick </code> and <code>triple ` inside</code>.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:blockquote": "'<blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">A blockquote\\n' +\n  'spanning two lines.</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote><h1>Heading inside a quote</h1><div class=\"paragraph\">And a paragraph.</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized inside quoted div</em>\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:code-block-with-html": "'<pre><code class=\"markdown-code-html\">&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>'",
  "simple-markdown:code-span": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Use the <code>printf()</code> function and <code> a ` b </code> for literal backticks.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text &lt;!-- trailing comment --&gt;</h1>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-backticks-in-table": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Code</th><th scope=\"col\">Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code></td><td>literal</td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-block": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Before the comment.</div><div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;!-- a standalone block comment --&gt;</div><div class=\"paragraph\">After the comment.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-in-code-span": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre><code class=\"markdown-code-html\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-in-indented-code": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;!-- comment inside an indented code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '    still code</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-in-list": "'<ul><li>First item\\n' +\n  '&lt;!-- comment between items --&gt;</li><li>Second item</li></ul>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-in-table-cell": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Col A</th><th scope=\"col\">Col B</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;!-- raw comment --&gt;</td><td>visible</td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-inline": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Text before &lt;!-- inline comment --&gt; and text after.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-multiline": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n--&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-only": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;!-- the entire document is only this comment --&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-pipe-in-table": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">A</th><th scope=\"col\">B</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;!-- a</td><td>b --&gt;</td><td>c</td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-unclosed": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Text then &lt;!-- an unclosed comment that never ends</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-with-markdown": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;!-- <strong>bold</strong> <em>italic</em> and <a href=\"https://example.com\">a link</a> inside a comment --&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:comment-with-raw-html": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;!-- &lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;raw tags&lt;/div&gt; and &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; inside --&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:consecutive-emphasis": "'<div class=\"paragraph\"><strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:div-markdown-attr": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div markdown=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>does markdown=&quot;1&quot; change anything?</em>\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:emoji-shortcode": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:emphasis": "'<div class=\"paragraph\"><em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <u>bold</u> and <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></div>'",
  "simple-markdown:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<div class=\"paragraph\"><em>open &lt;span&gt;span&lt;/span&gt; still emphasized</em></div>'",
  "simple-markdown:emphasis-in-link": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Not a table: a | b | c just text with escaped pipes.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:fenced-code": "'<pre><code>plain fenced code\\nno language</code></pre>'",
  "simple-markdown:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre><code class=\"markdown-code-js\">const x = 1;\\n' +\n  'console.log(x);</code></pre>'",
  "simple-markdown:footnote": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Here is a statement with a footnote.[^1]</div><div class=\"paragraph\">[^1]: This is the footnote definition.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:footnote-multiple": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">First reference[^a] and second reference[^b] in one paragraph.</div><div class=\"paragraph\">[^a]: First footnote.\\n' +\n  '[^b]: Second footnote with <strong>bold</strong>.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:hard-break-backslash": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Line one with a backslash\\\\\\n' +\n  'Line two after a hard break.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:hard-break-spaces": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Line one with trailing spaces<br>Line two after a hard break.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;</div><h1>a heading</h1><div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;/div&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;\\n# not a heading\\n&lt;/div&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2><div class=\"paragraph\">Some text under the heading.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:html-block": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;p&gt;A raw HTML block.&lt;/p&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:html-inside-table": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Tag</th><th scope=\"col\">Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>bold</td><td>&lt;strong&gt;hi&lt;/strong&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>break</td><td>a&lt;br&gt;b</td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:image": "'<div class=\"paragraph\"><img src=\"https://example.com/image.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"Image Title\"></div>'",
  "simple-markdown:indented-code": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">indented code block\\n    second line</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:inline-html": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Text with &lt;strong&gt;inline html&lt;/strong&gt; and a &lt;br&gt; break.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:inline-link": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:intraword-emphasis": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo_bar_baz and 5<em>6</em>7</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:issue-reference": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:link-with-parens-in-url": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation)\">Wikipedia</a> article.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:link-with-title": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Example Title\">titled link</a> here.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:list-in-div-loose": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;</div><ul><li>a list item</li><li>another list item</li></ul><div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;/div&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:list-in-div-tight": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  '- not a list item\\n' +\n  '- still not a list\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul><li><div class=\"paragraph\">A list item containing</div><blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">a blockquote\\n' +\n  'inside the item</div></blockquote></li><li><div class=\"paragraph\">Next item</div></li></ul>'",
  "simple-markdown:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol start=\"1\"><li><div class=\"paragraph\">First step:</div><pre><code class=\"markdown-code-bash\">echo hello</code></pre></li><li><div class=\"paragraph\">Second step after the code block.</div></li></ol>'",
  "simple-markdown:loose-list": "'<ul><li><div class=\"paragraph\">Item one</div></li><li><div class=\"paragraph\">Item two with a blank line before it</div></li></ul>'",
  "simple-markdown:math-block": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\n$$</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:math-inline": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</div><div class=\"paragraph\"><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em></div>'",
  "simple-markdown:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized — still in the HTML block</em></div>'",
  "simple-markdown:md-in-div-loose": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;</div><div class=\"paragraph\"><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></div><div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;/div&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:md-in-div-tight": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;div&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized</em> and <strong>not bold</strong>\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Inline &lt;code&gt;<em>emphasized inside a code tag</em>&lt;/code&gt; here.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:md-in-inline-span": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Inline &lt;span&gt;<em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong>&lt;/span&gt; stay markdown.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:md-in-pre": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;pre&gt;\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized</em> and # not a heading\\n' +\n  '&lt;/pre&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:md-in-table-html": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;table&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;<em>not emphasized</em> in a raw table&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/table&gt;</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:mention": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:multiple-blank-lines": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Paragraph one.</div><div class=\"paragraph\">Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:named-entity": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Ampersand &amp;amp; copyright &amp;copy; less-than &amp;lt; and a non-entity &amp;nbsp;.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote><div class=\"paragraph\">Outer\\n' +\n  '&gt; Inner nested\\n' +\n  '&gt; quote</div></blockquote>'",
  "simple-markdown:nested-list": "'<ul><li>Top\\n' +\n  '<ul><li>Nested one</li><li>Nested two\\n' +\n  '<ul><li>Deeper</li></ul></li></ul></li><li>Back to top</li></ul>'",
  "simple-markdown:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol start=\"1\"><li>Ordered parent\\n' +\n  '<ul><li>Unordered child\\n' +\n  '1. Ordered grandchild</li><li>Another child</li></ul></li></ol>'",
  "simple-markdown:numeric-entity": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Decimal &amp;#35; and hex &amp;#x263A; entities.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:ordered-list": "'<ol start=\"1\"><li>First</li><li>Second</li><li>Third</li></ol>'",
  "simple-markdown:ordered-list-start": "'<ol start=\"5\"><li>Five</li><li>Six</li><li>Seven</li></ol>'",
  "simple-markdown:paragraphs-softbreak": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.</div><div class=\"paragraph\">A second paragraph.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:pointy-autolink": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Pointy autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a> and email <a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">test@example.com</a>.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:raw-html-comment": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Before comment.</div><div class=\"paragraph\">&lt;!-- this is an HTML comment --&gt;</div><div class=\"paragraph\">After comment.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:reference-link": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">A <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Reference\">reference link</a> in text.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1><h2>Heading two</h2>'",
  "simple-markdown:setext-vs-list": "'<h2>- item</h2>'",
  "simple-markdown:special-chars-in-text": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Less-than &lt; and greater-than &gt; and ampersand &amp; and quote &quot; in plain text.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:strikethrough-double": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">This is <del>struck through</del> text.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:strikethrough-nested": "'<div class=\"paragraph\"><del>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</del></div>'",
  "simple-markdown:strikethrough-single": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">This is ~single tilde~ text.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:table-alignment": "'<table><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align:left;\" scope=\"col\">Left</th><th style=\"text-align:center;\" scope=\"col\">Center</th><th style=\"text-align:right;\" scope=\"col\">Right</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:left;\">a</td><td style=\"text-align:center;\">b</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">c</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left;\">dd</td><td style=\"text-align:center;\">ee</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">ff</td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:table-basic": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Fruit</th><th scope=\"col\">Color</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Apple</td><td>Red</td></tr><tr><td>Lime</td><td>Green</td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:table-escaped-pipe": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Column</th><th scope=\"col\">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>pipe</td><td>a | b</td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:table-inline-formatting": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Syntax</th><th scope=\"col\">Renders</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>code</code></td><td><strong>bold</strong></td></tr><tr><td><del>old</del></td><td><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:table-no-body": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Header A</th><th scope=\"col\">Header B</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td></td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:table-ragged": "'<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">A</th><th scope=\"col\">B</th><th scope=\"col\">C</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>only one</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>4</td></tr></tbody></table>'",
  "simple-markdown:tagfilter": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">A &lt;title&gt; tag and a &lt;textarea&gt; and &lt;xmp&gt; and &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; raw.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:tasklist": "'<ul><li>[x] Completed task</li><li>[ ] Incomplete task</li><li>[X] Capital X also checked</li></ul>'",
  "simple-markdown:tasklist-nested": "'<ul><li>[ ] Parent task\\n' +\n  '<ul><li>[x] Child done</li><li>[ ] Child todo</li></ul></li></ul>'",
  "simple-markdown:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul><li>[x] Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li><li>[ ] Task with <code>code</code></li></ul>'",
  "simple-markdown:thematic-break": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Above</div><hr aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"paragraph\">Below</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul><li>tight one</li><li>tight two</li></ul><div class=\"paragraph\">paragraph between</div><ol start=\"1\"><li><div class=\"paragraph\">loose one</div></li><li><div class=\"paragraph\">loose two</div></li></ol>'",
  "simple-markdown:unicode-text": "'<div class=\"paragraph\">Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.</div>'",
  "simple-markdown:unordered-list": "'<ul><li>Apple</li><li>Banana</li><li>Cherry</li></ul>'",
  "snarkdown:alert-caution": "'<blockquote><a href=\"undefined\">!CAUTION</a>\\n' +\n  'Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.</blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:alert-important": "'<blockquote><a href=\"undefined\">!IMPORTANT</a>\\n' +\n  'Key information users need to know to achieve their goal.</blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:alert-note": "'<blockquote><a href=\"undefined\">!NOTE</a>\\n' +\n  'Useful information that users should know, even when skimming content.</blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:alert-tip": "'<blockquote><a href=\"undefined\">!TIP</a>\\n' +\n  'Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.</blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:alert-warning": "'<blockquote><a href=\"undefined\">!WARNING</a>\\n' +\n  'Urgent info that needs immediate user attention to avoid problems.</blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:ampersand-in-url": "'A <a href=\"https://example.com/search?a=1&b=2&c=3\">query link</a> with ampersands.'",
  "snarkdown:atx-headings": "'<h1>Heading 1</h1><h2>Heading 2</h2><h3>Heading 3</h3><h4>Heading 4</h4><h5>Heading 5</h5><h6>Heading 6</h6>'",
  "snarkdown:autolink-email": "'Email me at someone@example.com please.'",
  "snarkdown:autolink-in-parentheses": "'A link www.example.com/foo<em>(bar) with balanced parens.</em>'",
  "snarkdown:autolink-trailing-punctuation": "'See (https://example.com) and https://example.com. and https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2.'",
  "snarkdown:autolink-url": "'Visit https://example.com for more, or http://test.org too.'",
  "snarkdown:autolink-www": "'Check out www.example.com for details.'",
  "snarkdown:backslash-escapes": "'\\\\<em>not emphasis\\\\* and \\\\`not code\\\\` and \\\\# not heading and \\\\[not link\\\\]</em>'",
  "snarkdown:backtick-in-code": "'Inline `<code> code with </code> backtick `<code> and </code>`<code>triple </code> inside```.'",
  "snarkdown:blockquote": "'<blockquote>A blockquote\\nspanning two lines.</blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:blockquote-with-heading": "'<blockquote><h1>Heading inside a quote</h1>And a paragraph.</blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:blockquote-with-html-md": "'<blockquote><div>\\n' +\n  '<em>not emphasized inside quoted div</em>\\n' +\n  '</div></blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:code-block-with-html": "'<pre class=\"code html\"><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot;&gt;\\n' +\n  '  &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>'",
  "snarkdown:code-span": "'Use the <code>printf()</code> function and `<code> a </code> b `` for literal backticks.'",
  "snarkdown:comment-after-heading": "'<h1>Heading text <!-- trailing comment --></h1>'",
  "snarkdown:comment-backticks-in-table": "'| Code | Note |\\n| ---- | ---- |\\n| <code>&lt;!-- c --&gt;</code> | literal |'",
  "snarkdown:comment-block": "'Before the comment.<br /><!-- a standalone block comment --><br />After the comment.'",
  "snarkdown:comment-in-code-span": "'Inline code <code>&lt;!-- not a real comment --&gt;</code> must stay literal.'",
  "snarkdown:comment-in-fenced-code": "'<pre class=\"code html\"><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;!-- comment inside a fenced code block --&gt;\\n' +\n  '&lt;div&gt;x&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>'",
  "snarkdown:comment-in-indented-code": "'<!-- comment inside an indented code block --><pre class=\"code poetry\"><code>still code</code></pre>'",
  "snarkdown:comment-in-list": "'<ul><li>First item</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '<!-- comment between items --><ul><li>Second item</li></ul>'",
  "snarkdown:comment-in-table-cell": "'| Col A | Col B |\\n| ----- | ----- |\\n| <!-- raw comment --> | visible |'",
  "snarkdown:comment-inline": "'Text before <!-- inline comment --> and text after.'",
  "snarkdown:comment-multiline": "'<!--\\nmulti-line\\ncomment body\\n-->'",
  "snarkdown:comment-only": "'<!-- the entire document is only this comment -->'",
  "snarkdown:comment-pipe-in-table": "'| A | B |\\n| - | - |\\n| <!-- a | b --> | c |'",
  "snarkdown:comment-unclosed": "'Text then <!-- an unclosed comment that never ends'",
  "snarkdown:comment-with-markdown": "'<!-- <strong>bold</strong> <em>italic</em> and <a href=\"https://example.com\">a link</a> inside a comment -->'",
  "snarkdown:comment-with-raw-html": "'<!-- <div class=\"x\">raw tags</div> and <script>alert(1)</script> inside -->'",
  "snarkdown:consecutive-emphasis": "'<strong>bold</strong><em>italic</em><strong>bold</strong> with no spaces between runs.'",
  "snarkdown:div-markdown-attr": "'<div markdown=\"1\">\\n<em>does markdown=\"1\" change anything?</em>\\n</div>'",
  "snarkdown:emoji-shortcode": "'Shipped it :rocket: and celebrated :tada: with :+1:.'",
  "snarkdown:emphasis": "'<em>italic</em> and <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong><em>bold italic<strong><em></em></strong></em></strong>'",
  "snarkdown:emphasis-across-inline-tag": "'<em>open <span>span</span> still emphasized</em>'",
  "snarkdown:emphasis-in-link": "'A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></a> text.'",
  "snarkdown:escaped-pipe-outside-table": "'Not a table: a \\\\| b \\\\| c just text with escaped pipes.'",
  "snarkdown:fenced-code": "'<pre class=\"code \"><code>plain fenced code\\nno language</code></pre>'",
  "snarkdown:fenced-code-lang": "'<pre class=\"code js\"><code class=\"language-js\">const x = 1;\\n' +\n  'console.log(x);</code></pre>'",
  "snarkdown:footnote": "'Here is a statement with a footnote.<a href=\"This is the footnote definition.\">^1</a>'",
  "snarkdown:footnote-multiple": "'First reference<a href=\"First footnote.\">^a</a> and second reference<a href=\"Second footnote with **bold**.\">^b</a> in one paragraph.'",
  "snarkdown:hard-break-backslash": "'Line one with a backslash\\\\\\nLine two after a hard break.'",
  "snarkdown:hard-break-spaces": "'Line one with trailing spaces<br />Line two after a hard break.'",
  "snarkdown:heading-in-div-loose": "'<div><h1>a heading</h1></div>'",
  "snarkdown:heading-in-div-tight": "'<div><h1>not a heading</h1></div>'",
  "snarkdown:heading-with-anchor": "'<h2>A Heading That Gets An Anchor</h2>Some text under the heading.'",
  "snarkdown:html-block": "'<div class=\"note\">\\n  <p>A raw HTML block.</p>\\n</div>'",
  "snarkdown:html-inside-table": "'| Tag | Example |\\n' +\n  '| --- | ------- |\\n' +\n  '| bold | <strong>hi</strong> |\\n' +\n  '| break | a<br>b |'",
  "snarkdown:image": "'<img src=\"https://example.com/image.png &quot;Image Title&quot;\" alt=\"alt text\">'",
  "snarkdown:indented-code": "'indented code block<pre class=\"code poetry\"><code>second line</code></pre>'",
  "snarkdown:inline-html": "'Text with <strong>inline html</strong> and a <br> break.'",
  "snarkdown:inline-link": "'An <a href=\"https://example.com\">inline link</a> in text.'",
  "snarkdown:intraword-emphasis": "'foo<em>bar</em>baz and foo<em>bar</em>baz and 5<em>6</em>7'",
  "snarkdown:issue-reference": "'Fixes #1 and relates to #42 in this repo.'",
  "snarkdown:link-with-parens-in-url": "'See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markdown_(disambiguation\">Wikipedia</a>) article.'",
  "snarkdown:link-with-title": "'A <a href=\"https://example.com &quot;Example Title&quot;\">titled link</a> here.'",
  "snarkdown:list-in-div-loose": "'<div><br /><ul><li>a list item</li><li>another list item</li></ul><br /></div>'",
  "snarkdown:list-in-div-tight": "'<div><ul><li>not a list item</li><li>still not a list</li></ul>\\n</div>'",
  "snarkdown:list-with-blockquote": "'<ul><li>A list item containing</li></ul><br />  > a blockquote\\n' +\n  '  > inside the item<br /><ul><li>Next item</li></ul>'",
  "snarkdown:list-with-fenced-code": "'<ol><li>First step:</li></ol><pre class=\"code poetry\"><code>```bash\\n' +\n  'echo hello\\n' +\n  '```</code></pre><ol><li>Second step after the code block.</li></ol>'",
  "snarkdown:loose-list": "'<ul><li>Item one</li></ul><br /><ul><li>Item two with a blank line before it</li></ul>'",
  "snarkdown:math-block": "'$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{n} \\\\sum<em>{i=1}^{n} x</em>i\\n$$'",
  "snarkdown:math-inline": "'The equation $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ is the Pythagorean theorem.'",
  "snarkdown:md-after-close-tag-loose": "'<div>\\n' +\n  'content\\n' +\n  '</div><br /><em>emphasized — the blank line ended the block</em>'",
  "snarkdown:md-after-close-tag-tight": "'<div>\\ncontent\\n</div>\\n<em>not emphasized — still in the HTML block</em>'",
  "snarkdown:md-in-div-loose": "'<div><br /><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong><br /></div>'",
  "snarkdown:md-in-div-tight": "'<div>\\n<em>not emphasized</em> and <strong>not bold</strong>\\n</div>'",
  "snarkdown:md-in-inline-code-tag": "'Inline <code><em>emphasized inside a code tag</em></code> here.'",
  "snarkdown:md-in-inline-span": "'Inline <span><em>emphasized</em> and <strong>bold</strong></span> stay markdown.'",
  "snarkdown:md-in-pre": "'<pre>\\n<em>not emphasized</em> and # not a heading\\n</pre>'",
  "snarkdown:md-in-table-html": "'<table>\\n<tr><td><em>not emphasized</em> in a raw table</td></tr>\\n</table>'",
  "snarkdown:mention": "'Thanks @octocat and @github for the help.'",
  "snarkdown:multiple-blank-lines": "'Paragraph one.<br />Paragraph two after multiple blank lines.'",
  "snarkdown:named-entity": "'Ampersand &amp; copyright &copy; less-than &lt; and a non-entity &nbsp;.'",
  "snarkdown:nested-blockquote": "'<blockquote>Outer<blockquote>Inner nested\\nquote</blockquote></blockquote>'",
  "snarkdown:nested-list": "'<ul><li>Top</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '  - Nested one\\n' +\n  '  - Nested two<pre class=\"code poetry\"><code>- Deeper</code></pre><ul><li>Back to top</li></ul>'",
  "snarkdown:nested-mixed-list": "'<ol><li>Ordered parent</li></ol><pre class=\"code poetry\"><code>- Unordered child\\n' +\n  '  1. Ordered grandchild\\n' +\n  '- Another child</code></pre>'",
  "snarkdown:numeric-entity": "'Decimal &#35; and hex &#x263A; entities.'",
  "snarkdown:ordered-list": "'<ol><li>First</li><li>Second</li><li>Third</li></ol>'",
  "snarkdown:ordered-list-start": "'<ol><li>Five</li><li>Six</li><li>Seven</li></ol>'",
  "snarkdown:paragraphs-softbreak": "'First line of a paragraph\\n' +\n  'second line after a soft break.<br />A second paragraph.'",
  "snarkdown:pointy-autolink": "'Pointy autolink <https://example.com> and email <test@example.com>.'",
  "snarkdown:raw-html-comment": "'Before comment.<br /><!-- this is an HTML comment --><br />After comment.'",
  "snarkdown:reference-link": "'A <a href=\"undefined\">reference link</a><a href=\"https://example.com &quot;Reference&quot;\">ref</a> in text.'",
  "snarkdown:setext-headings": "'<h1>Heading one</h1><h2>Heading two</h2>'",
  "snarkdown:setext-vs-list": "'<ul><li>item</li></ul>\\n---'",
  "snarkdown:special-chars-in-text": "'Less-than < and greater-than > and ampersand & and quote \" in plain text.'",
  "snarkdown:strikethrough-double": "'This is <s>struck through</s> text.'",
  "snarkdown:strikethrough-nested": "'<s>struck with <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> inside</s>'",
  "snarkdown:strikethrough-single": "'This is ~single tilde~ text.'",
  "snarkdown:table-alignment": "'| Left | Center | Right |\\n' +\n  '| :--- | :----: | ----: |\\n' +\n  '| a    | b      | c     |\\n' +\n  '| dd   | ee     | ff    |'",
  "snarkdown:table-basic": "'| Fruit | Color |\\n| ----- | ----- |\\n| Apple | Red |\\n| Lime  | Green |'",
  "snarkdown:table-escaped-pipe": "'| Column | Value |\\n| ------ | ----- |\\n| pipe   | a \\\\| b |'",
  "snarkdown:table-inline-formatting": "'| Syntax | Renders |\\n' +\n  '| ------ | ------- |\\n' +\n  '| <code>code</code> | <strong>bold</strong> |\\n' +\n  '| <s>old</s> | <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a> |'",
  "snarkdown:table-no-body": "'| Header A | Header B |\\n| -------- | -------- |'",
  "snarkdown:table-ragged": "'| A | B | C |\\n| - | - | - |\\n| only one |\\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 |'",
  "snarkdown:tagfilter": "'A <title> tag and a <textarea> and <xmp> and <script>alert(1)</script> raw.'",
  "snarkdown:tasklist": "'<ul><li><a href=\"undefined\">x</a> Completed task</li><li><a href=\"undefined\"> </a> Incomplete task</li><li><a href=\"undefined\">X</a> Capital X also checked</li></ul>'",
  "snarkdown:tasklist-nested": "'<ul><li><a href=\"undefined\"> </a> Parent task</li></ul>\\n' +\n  '  - <a href=\"undefined\">x</a> Child done\\n' +\n  '  - <a href=\"undefined\"> </a> Child todo'",
  "snarkdown:tasklist-with-formatting": "'<ul><li><a href=\"undefined\">x</a> Task with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></li><li><a href=\"undefined\"> </a> Task with <code>code</code></li></ul>'",
  "snarkdown:thematic-break": "'Above<hr />\\nBelow'",
  "snarkdown:tight-vs-loose": "'<ul><li>tight one</li><li>tight two</li></ul><br />paragraph between<br /><ol><li>loose one</li></ol><br /><ol><li>loose two</li></ol>'",
  "snarkdown:unicode-text": "'Unicode: café, naïve, 日本語, emoji 🎉, and combining e\\\\u0301.'",
  "snarkdown:unordered-list": "'<ul><li>Apple</li><li>Banana</li><li>Cherry</li></ul>'"
}